  "legal.draft_notice": "DRAFT — pending legal review",
  "legal.privacy_title": "Privacy Policy",
  "legal.privacy_body": "## Who we are\nArvo is an app for keeping an eye on your fields with satellite data, weather and scouting notes. This notice explains what data we process and the rights you have under the GDPR (EU Regulation 2016/679).\n\n## What data we collect\n— Account: name, email, farm business name and language.\n— Fields: boundaries, crops and areas you draw or import from the cadastre.\n— Scouting and photos: the notes and images you record in the field.\n— Location: only when you use it, to pin a note to the right spot in the field. You can deny it at any time.\n— Minimal technical data needed to run and protect the service.\n\n## Why we use it\nOnly to provide the service: showing your fields, computing indicators, sending the alerts you choose. Legal basis: our contract with you (art. 6.1.b GDPR); for optional notifications, your consent.\n\n## Where the data lives\nOn servers in the European Union.\n\n## Who we share it with\nWe do not sell your data and we do not hand it over for advertising. It is seen only by the people you invite into your business and by the strictly necessary technical providers (hosting, notification delivery), bound by contract.\n\n## How long we keep it\nFor as long as your account is active. If you delete it, we erase your data within 30 days, unless the law requires otherwise.\n\n## Your rights\nYou can request a copy of your data (export), correction, deletion or restriction of processing at any time, and you can lodge a complaint with your data protection authority. Write to us from the Help & contact page: we answer free of charge.",
  "legal.terms_title": "Terms of Service",
  "legal.terms_body": "## The service\nArvo helps you follow your fields with satellite data, weather and scouting notes. The guidance is decision support: it does not replace an agronomist's advice.\n\n## Your account\nKeep your credentials and what you enter safe. You can invite other people from your business and decide their roles.\n\n## Your data stays yours\nFields, scouting notes and photos are yours. You grant us only the technical permission to store and process them for you. You can export or delete them at any time; we never resell them.\n\n## Fair use\nNo illegal use, no harming others. We may suspend accounts that abuse the service.\n\n## Service limits\nThe service is provided \"as is\": satellite and weather data can be delayed or imprecise. To the extent allowed by law, we are not liable for agronomic decisions taken based on the app.\n\n## Changes\nIf these terms change substantially we will tell you in the app with reasonable notice.\n\n## Governing law\nItalian law applies and, where required, the consumer's court of residence.",
